&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The class was nothing special, but the food was really a food paradise near National Cheng Kung University. It was completely different from what it was two weeks ago.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/post/2025-ais3-junior-%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97/4.jpg&#34;
