&lt;p&gt;I went back to discuss and work on the topic. I remember that I finished it very quickly. Then I went to the place I didn’t go in the morning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;day-2&#34;&gt;Day 2
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I don’t remember much the next day, but there was one thing that left a lasting impression on me. Remember that hamburger steak that I took a picture of and it looked really ugly? When I went to eat it for the second time, it made a big comeback in my stomach (I was so funny because I didn’t notice it).&lt;br&gt;
The hamburger patty was a little pink, but I ate it anyway.&lt;br&gt;
Later I developed acute gastroenteritis. I had diarrhea no matter what I ate, and I also had diarrhea even if I didn&amp;rsquo;t eat. I felt very uncomfortable for the next few days.&lt;br&gt;
But I still have to go eat what I didn&amp;rsquo;t get to this morning&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://maps.app.goo.gl/AmhBAreU4wRBUTm88&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
