&lt;h1 id=&#34;project&#34;&gt;Project
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our project was called &amp;ldquo;Side-Channel Attack to Steal ATM Keyboard Input: Using MLP to Analyze Keyboard Keystroke Sounds.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It mainly uses a microphone to record for MLP analysis of &amp;ldquo;the subtle sound waves generated when keyboards are pressed at different key positions.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Presentation slides - &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xlztO7MaDAHdUmDrSL4mTH_6TC2MzSpV/view?usp=sharing&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;click me&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to try it yourself, you can &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.coogle.com.tw/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
