&lt;p&gt;Finally, here&amp;rsquo;s the GitHub repo - you can &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/heyaustin/Coogle.git&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;go give it a star&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;summary&#34;&gt;Summary
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;AIS3 is awesome!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Free accommodation plus a quality learning environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plus they let everyone gather in the basement to grind together and pull all-nighters together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This experience was really special.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even though I didn&amp;rsquo;t understand all the courses completely, it was fun and I&amp;rsquo;ll definitely go again next year.&lt;/p&gt;
